# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRONTEND environment (Vite). Everything here is compiled into the
# browser bundle and is therefore PUBLIC. Server-side configuration —
# database, JWT, and the DPO payment credentials — lives in
# backend/.env and must never be duplicated here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# VITE_API_URL: Public base URL of the backend API the browser calls.
VITE_API_URL="http://localhost:3001"

# VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY: Web Push public key. MUST equal the backend's
# WEB_PUSH_PUBLIC_KEY. Public by design — it is the public half of the pair.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=""

# ── Payments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is deliberately NO payment credential in this file.
#
# DPO is a hosted-page provider: the browser never talks to DPO's API. It
# calls our backend, the backend calls DPO with DPO_COMPANY_TOKEN, and the
# payer is redirected to DPO's own page to enter card / mobile-money details.
# Nyuwe never handles those details and never needs a client-side PSP key.
#
# A `LENCO_API_KEY` used to sit here and was inlined into the bundle by a
# Vite `define`, shipping the merchant credential to every visitor. Do not
# reintroduce that shape for DPO or anything else.
#
# Payment settings live in backend/.env — see DPO_PAYMENTS_INTEGRATION.md.
